<p>
  Call each of the methods in the main method and print out the results. All methods should be static. Be sure to label your output with the corresponding information for each number.
</p>
</statement>
<program interactive="activecode" language="java">
<code>
import java.util.ArrayList;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

